// The RFC 08 §5 type table (v1.5, H6): every type/request/reply/attachment
// name in the registry set must resolve here — the zenkey-build lint fails
// the build otherwise. `kind` names the schema-document kind a describe
// reply serves for the type (RFC 08 §7).

